    "scenario": "BGP Allow AS In",
    "goals": "• Configure IBGP within AS {{as1}}, source BGP updates from the loopback0 interfaces.\n  AS {{as1}}: {{router1_name}}, {{router3_name}}, {{router4_name}}\n  AS {{as2}}: {{router2_name}}\n• Configure EBGP between router {{router4_name}} and {{router2_name}}.\n• Configure EBGP between router {{router1_name}} and {{router2_name}}.\n• Advertise the loopback1 interfaces in BGP on router {{router4_name}} and {{router1_name}}.\n• Ensure router {{router4_name}} and {{router1_name}} can still reach each others loopback interfaces when router {{router3_name}} fails; the alternate route is through AS {{as2}} and contains AS {{as1}} in the AS path.",
